  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6606.02 Annual Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6606.02 Annual Permit. The fee for an annual permit shall be the same as Saf-C 6606.01, except that an owner shall only be charged the amount set forth in Saf-C 6606.01(a)(1) once. The remainder of the fees shall be charged for each shipment transported through the state.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
